  "reasoning_summary": "Answers align with a **low-extraversion, high-neuroticism**, Italian university student (Milan) who thrives in structured yet creative fields (*chemistry*, *philosophy*). Math’s anxiety stems from self-doubt and task complexity, but conscientiousness drives disciplined practice. AI adoption is hypothetical due to education level; step-by-step explanations reflect neurotic over-checking. PCA and LLMs are framed with pragmatism—balancing innovation risk (agreeableness concerns) against problem-solving agency."
